{"title": "第十八章", "index": 1490, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre4\" id=\"IOQ2C0-f63310eb08dd4d5faea408e62c2fdc23\">\n<div class=\"calibre15\" id=\"chapter\">\n<p class=\"calibre12\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-kai\">大道废，有仁义。智慧出，有大伪。六亲不和有孝慈。国家昏乱有忠臣。</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}